      "year": 2026,
      "abstract": "Is this the blueprint for a utopia of abundance, or a road map to mass displacement? This question lies at the heart of the current AI revolution. Andreessen's vision extends beyond mere cost reduction; he argues that for artificial intelligence to usher in an economic utopia, it must first cause a dramatic fall in human wages, leading to a future defined by a massive surge in productivity and a collapse in the prices of goods and services.",
